  "details": "As title says OSC is non functional while connected to any Mullvad VPN server, while saying this error in output log:\n\n\"23/05/2023 18:38:41 Error - [Always] Could not Start OSC: The requested address is not valid in this context\". I have no launch options to modify the port or anything, just vanilla OSC settings. It used to work before 2023, if i recall correctly since I've used XSOverlay OSC fine on my avatar. There's a post on ask forums talking about the same issue a while back: https://ask.vrchat.com/t/osc-wont-start-with-vpn-on/17009. It seems it is quite recent issue.",
